          {
            "name": "Ancient Wisdom",
            "description": "After landing 5 Basic Attacks, he becomes enhanced. While enhanced, he gains Attack Speed and Movement Speed. Each Basic Attack deals extra true damage and reduces the cooldown of Skills 1 and 2.",
